{
  "id": 8867087515847,
  "title": "Rooster Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animal Bedding - Chicken",
  "handle": "rooster-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animal-bedding-chicken",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance and create a cozy, timeless bedroom with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set is perfect for adding warmth and tradition to any space, making it a thoughtful gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a charming Farmhouse Patchwork style pattern, perfect for a rustic aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases and a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Available in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried for quick and easy maintenance, ensuring the microfiber remains fluffy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable polycotton for comfort and longevity.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
